{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"I've decided that Arcania really is my new place in the world, and I really feel at home here. Many people are already doing their best to help different parts of the city, but I realized that I don't know as much about living here as I should.\"\nRoy shakes his head with a smile. \"I suppose I really am the least local out of everyone here. What would you say are the most important values of people here? Like, with all the trouble coming from the outside, what's something that could be better to make sure all the kids here can be happy?\"\n\n\"Sorry if I'm asking too much out of nowhere, but... I feel like in trying to help the city, I might not have given enough time to Ferrytown, and want to correct it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T08:18:33.487000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877104101010309121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
